{"id":"H3378","lemma":"יְרֻבַּ֫עַל","transliteration":"yerubbaal","sayIt":"ye-rub-BA-al","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Jerubbaal","meaning":"A man living before Israel's Monarchy, first mentioned at Jdg.6.11;\nson of: Joash (H3101);\nfather of: Jether (H3500), Abimelech (H0040H) and Jotham (H3147); also called Jerubbaal at Jdg.6.32; 7.1; 8.29,35; 9.1,2,5,16,19,24,28,57; 1xJerubbesheth at 2Sa.11.21;\nAnother name of gid.on (גִּדְעוֹן \"Gideon\" H1439)\n§ Jerubbaal = \"let Baal contend\"\nname given to Gideon by his father when he destroyed the altar of Baal","glosses":["jerubbaal","he—jerubbaal"],"count":13,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"jdg-6","v":32,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jerubbaal","kjv":"him Jerubbaal"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-7","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jerubbaal","kjv":"Then Jerubbaal"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-8","v":29,"renderings":{"bsb":"and he—Jerubbaal","kjv":"And Jerubbaal"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-8","v":35,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Jerubbaal","kjv":"of Jerubbaal"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-9","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Jerubbaal","kjv":"of Jerubbaal"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-9","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Jerubbaal","kjv":"of Jerubbaal"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-9","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Jerubbaal","kjv":"of Jerubbaal"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-9","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jerubbaal","kjv":"with Jerubbaal"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-9","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jerubbaal","kjv":"with Jerubbaal"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-9","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Jerubbaal","kjv":"of Jerubbaal"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-9","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Jerubbaal","kjv":"of Jerubbaal"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-9","v":57,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Jerubbaal"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-12","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jerubbaal","kjv":"Jerubbaal"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Judges 6:32","note":"Therefore on that day he named him Jerub-Baal, saying, “Let Baal contend against him, because he has broken down his altar.”","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Samuel 12:11","note":"Yahweh sent Jerubbaal, Bedan, Jephthah, and Samue